# ===================================================================
# Docker 构建上下文过滤 - 加速 COPY, 减小上下文
# ===================================================================

# Maven 构建产物 (本阶段自己 build, 不用复制)
**/target/
**/build/

# IDE 配置
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
.vscode/
.project
.classpath
.settings/

# Git
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# 测试产物 / 覆盖率报告
**/test-output/
**/surefire-reports/
**/jacoco.exec
**/dependency-check-report.html
**/dependency-check-report.xml
**/dependency-check-junit.xml

# OS 文件
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# 日志
**/*.log

# 文档 (与构建无关)
**/README.md
**/AGENTS.md
**/CLAUDE.md
**/CHANGELOG.md
**/docs/
**/doc/

# Docker 自身
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# 环境变量 (防止凭据泄露到镜像)
**/.env*
!**/.env.example

# 证书/密钥
**/*.p12
**/*.jks
**/*.pem
**/*.keystore
**/*.truststore

# CI/CD
.github/
.gitlab-ci.yml
Jenkinsfile
